{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Token.Token</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":true,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"revpn-ccsk","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Revpn_ccsk","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Token","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Token","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.Tok_empty\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.Tok_empty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Tok_empty</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.Tok\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.Tok\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Tok</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <a href=\"../../Lts/index.html#type-label\">Lts.label</a> * <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> list</span> * int</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Let <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">N = \\langle S, T, F, \\lambda, \\mathsf{A} \\rangle</code> be a labelled net. <code>token</code> is the type of tokens defined inductively as:</p><div><pre class=\"odoc-katex-math display\">\\cfrac{}{\\mathsf{Tok\\_empty : token}} \\qquad\\qquad \u000A     \\cfrac{a\\in\\mathsf{A} \\qquad ls\\mathsf{ : [token]} \\qquad i \\in \\mathbb N}{\\mathsf{Tok}(a, ls, i)\\mathsf{ : token}}</pre></div><ul><li><code>Tok_empty</code>: <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">(\\cdot, \\langle\\!\\langle \\rangle\\!\\rangle, \\cdot)</code></li><li><code>Tok (a, ls, i)</code>: if <code>ls</code> has <code>token</code> type, <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">(a, \\langle\\!\\langle w_1,\\dots,w_n\\rangle\\!\\rangle, i)</code> with <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">a</code> an action, <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">w_1,\\dots,w_n</code> are tokens and <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">i\\in\\mathbb N</code> an identificator number.</li></ul><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-size\"><a href=\"#val-size\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> size : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The <i>size</i> of a token is defined as follows: <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">\\mathsf{size}((\\cdot,\\langle\\!\\langle \\rangle\\!\\rangle,\\cdot))=0</code> and <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">\\mathsf{size}((a,\\langle\\!\\langle w_1,\\dots, w_n \\rangle\\!\\rangle,j))= \\max\\{\\mathsf{size(w_i) \\mid 1\\le i \\le n}\\} + 1</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare\"><a href=\"#val-compare\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal\"><a href=\"#val-equal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div>"}